WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 1.9 · Strategic Foundations
Strategic objectives: external and internal

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Turn your mission into a few priorities you can actually resource.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Set external objectives for change, internal ones for capacity.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Give each a code, a picture of success and an owner.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Write down what you will postpone to make room.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You write your objectives with codes, owners and what you will postpone.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
